   "text": "Tests run on a copy of the workspace before anyone reviews. Only passing code reaches the AI reviewer, and only\nreviewed code reaches the human. A reject carries the human's reason back to the coder. Apply writes the real files;\nverify runs the tests once more on them.",
   "originalText": "Tests run on a copy of the workspace before anyone reviews. Only passing code reaches the AI reviewer, and only\nreviewed code reaches the human. A reject carries the human's reason back to the coder. Apply writes the real files;\nverify runs the tests once more on them.",
